\ A reachable method{ body the IR backend cannot compile to native code: it
\ returns a quotation value, which compiled code cannot reify. Under
\ --emit-runtime-image the body is serialized and runs through the interpreter,
\ so the replayed method result is observed -- the generic default would print
\ -1.

counter: virtual{ fixnum } ;
bump:    generic ( c -- n ) [ drop -1 ] ;
bump:    method{ counter } [ drop [ 7 ] ] ;

0 >counter bump .
